{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059771 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059580 :question/id #uuid "836f2f1b-5dd4-5dba-81cc-eb9ffe7db8d1" :question/math-academy-id "e-4693" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $A,$ given by\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 7 & 12 & 13\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation $R_2 := R_2 +(- 4) \\cdot R_1$ on $A?$" :question/worked-solution "The operation $R_2:=R_2 + (-4) R_1$ means that we need to add $-4$ times the first row to the second row. \n\nCarrying out this row operation, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 7 & 12 & 13\\end{bmatrix}\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-4)\\cdot {R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 4+(-4)(1) & 2+(-4)(2) & -1+(-4)(3) \\\\ 7 & 12 & 13\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -6 & -13 \\\\ 7 & 12 & 13\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eb1afe82-86ba-5a15-9037-74717692ecb2" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050163}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186525196} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059961 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a5a9bba7-f581-5372-a873-0fc17a55fb02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & -9 \\\\ 8 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056126} {:answer/id #uuid "b9c177a1-6771-55e3-bd09-bf47def49ac2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 & 9 \\\\ 8 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056127} {:answer/id #uuid "0d1d8e7e-44fc-5700-9bdc-f19ade4437e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 9\\end{bmat